; The ONE variable: `internationalization/locale/test`, set to a right-to-left
; language in this directory's own project.godot. Every node leaves
; `layout_direction` at INHERITED and `root_node_layout_direction` is unset, so
; the root falls through to the application locale (control.cpp:3607) —
; `TranslationServer::setup` seeds that from the test locale when the project
; states one (translation_server.cpp:592-599) and
; `TextServerAdvanced::_is_locale_right_to_left` answers from a fixed
; seven-code table (text_server_adv.cpp:534-541). Invisible in every loose
; fixture, and in the two sibling directories: they answer from a setting that
; never consults a locale at all.

